### DIRECTORIES
secrets/ | Secret storage (NEVER in git) - per GR-5

### RULES
- secrets/ directory is EXCLUDED from git
- Permissions: root:dinssystem, dirs 770, files 660
- Only root and dinssystem group may access secrets

### RELATED
config/ | Non-secret configuration (safe for git)
